Domain Entity LearningStandard
    documentation 'This entity is a sub-element of a learning objective consisting of a precise 
                  'statement of the expectation of a student's proficiency.
    shared string LearningStandardId named LearningStandardId
        documentation 'The identifier for the specific learning standard (e.g., 111.15.3.1.A).
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    include LearningStandardIdentificationCode
        documentation 'A coding scheme that is used for identification and record-keeping purposes by 
                      'schools, social services, or other agencies to refer to a learning standard.
        is optional collection
        is queryable field
    shared string Description named Description
        documentation 'The text of the statement. The textual content that either describes a specific 
                      'competency such as "Apply the Pythagorean Theorem to determine unknown side 
                      'lengths in right triangles in real-world and mathematical problems in two and 
                      'three dimensions." or describes a less granular group of competencies within the 
                      'taxonomy of the standards document, e.g. "Understand and apply the Pythagorean 
                      'Theorem," or "Geometry".
        is required
    shared string IdentificationCode named LearningStandardItemCode
        documentation 'A code designated by the promulgating body to identify the statement, e.g. 1.N.3 
                      '(usually not globally unique).
        is optional
    include ContentStandard
        documentation 'The content standard from which the LearningStandard was derived.
        is required
        is queryable field
    shared string URI named URI
        documentation 'An unambiguous reference to the statement using a network-resolvable URI.
        is optional
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation 'The grade levels for the specific learning standard.
        is required collection
        is queryable field
    descriptor AcademicSubject
        documentation 'Subject area for the LearningStandard.
        is required
        is queryable field
    string CourseTitle
        documentation 'The official Course Title with which this learning standard is associated.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 60
    string Criteria
        documentation 'One or more statements that describes the criteria used by teachers and students 
                      'to check for attainment of a learning standard. This criteria gives clear 
                      'indications as to the degree to which learning is moving through the Zone or 
                      'Proximal Development toward independent achievement of the LearningStandard.
        is optional
        with context Success
        min length 1
        max length 150
    reference LearningStandard
        documentation 'The unique identifier of a prerequisite learning standard item, a competency 
                      'needed prior to learning this one. (Some items may have no prerequisites others 
                      'may have one or more prerequisites. This should only be used to represent the 
                      'immediate predecessors in a competency-based pathway, i.e. not prerequisites of 
                      'prerequisites).
        is optional collection
        with context Prerequisite
    reference LearningStandard
        documentation 'Provide user information to lookup and link to an existing learning standard 
                      'which serves as a method to group other learning standards.
        is optional
        with context Parent
    shared string URI named Namespace
        documentation 'Namespace for the LearningStandard.
        is required